OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Aberdeen to Argentina: How my
OL,4,Astolen Ian Wright football top went
OL,5,Around the world
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was a prank that lasted for a
OL,8,Fquarter of a century. Simple yet
OL,9,Fbewildering for its unsuspecting
OL,10,Fvictim.
OL,12,FIt began in 2001 when Kevin Hill went
OL,13,Fsearching for his favourite football
OL,14,Ftop.
OL,16,FAs a kid in Aberdeen, he'd grown up as
OL,17,Fa Celtic fan - something he says that
OL,18,Frequired a thick skin.
OL,20,FHis father took him to games in Glasgow
OL,21,Fand every season, from age five, his
OL,22,Fparents bought him the latest strip.
